00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:11.000
Carmen Cruickshank: 30 to 50 is pretty average, so anything below that is really good, you know? So…

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:22.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, and then… not Google. Meta determines that on how it sees the quality of the ad, so it sees if your ad is really good, it'll just show it to everyone for you at a lower cost, you know?

