00:07:55.000 --> 00:08:06.000
Carmen Cruickshank: It's good. Also, sometimes people have high click-through rates, maybe like 5%, but they're not actually getting conversions, so it's just curiosity. So it's not always, like, higher is better.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.000
Jillian: Mm-hmm.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.000
