00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:34.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And then that's where I'm thinking sometimes too, that a retargeting campaign would be helpful. That's more kind of building in layers. If you want to do, sometimes you could even do a retargeting campaign for like $3 a day. We don't have to do that right now. It's just in the future, if that's your idea.

